{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nDresden is beautiful, but the heat is oppressive. This morning I visited the Picture Gallery and was at the art exhibition. The colors are vivid, yet the mood is melancholy. Afterwards, I went to the Brühl's Terrace. I was there yesterday as well, but today the view of the Elbe was clearer. The wind from the breeze was refreshing.\n\nI sat with Ammon for an hour. We spoke about what is currently being discussed in the city. It is quiet here, but the thoughts are turning. I am not yet tired, but the evening is approaching.\n\nI will now return to the Gallery and then go to Tieck. Please give my regards to Karl and Immanuel. I am thinking of you.\n\nYours\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221176,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":168,"prompt_tokens":247,"total_tokens":415,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Os9r49QrsgHzX8KPWOpRSd4k0JKmNa2q","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":247,"prompt_ms":417.055,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.6884817813765183,"prompt_per_second":592.2480248408483,"predicted_n":168,"predicted_ms":3892.408,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.30783233532934,"predicted_per_second":42.9040326707786}}